---
/**
 * Shown on every legal page until counsel has reviewed it. Remove the
 * `draft` prop from a page's LegalLayout to hide it there, or delete this
 * component once the whole pack is signed off.
 */
---

<aside
  class="mt-8 rounded-md border border-(--color-warn) bg-(--color-warn)/8 px-5 py-4"
  role="note"
>
  <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-(--color-warn) uppercase">
    Unreviewed draft
  </p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-(--color-ink-muted)">
    This page has not been reviewed by a lawyer. It is published so the
    structure can be read and edited, and it should not be relied on as the
    terms of any agreement. Bracketed values are placeholders that still need
    filling in.
  </p>
</aside>
